  "title": "Global Integration of Technology and Space for National Geopolitical Advancement",
  "summary": "Union Minister Gajendra Shekhawat emphasized the convergence of space technology, AI, and other cutting-edge innovations to shape India's geopolitical future. The event highlighted the country's commitment to fostering technological leadership and private sector participation in these fields.",
